  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can feast upon a broad variety of blood that other dhampirs find impossible to digest.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Diverse Palate<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may choose an additional humanoid subtype, plus one additional subtype per 3 tiers after 1st. This feat functions when drinking the blood of any of the chosen subtypes. Alternatively, you may choose a single creature type other than humanoids from which you can draw blood to survive. The creatures you drain must have blood and Intelligence 3 or greater.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc103\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
